style='mso-bookmark:_hlk165400452'></span></a><span style='mso-bookmark:_hlk165400452'><i
style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>
Sayılı 3. Mükerrer R.G.</span></i></span><b><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'><o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><i
style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
background:silver;mso-highlight:silver;mso-fareast-language:TR'>İhracat
Destekleri Hakkında Karar (CK <a
data-tooltip='CK 2022-05973 İhracat Destekleri Hakkında Karar' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/ihracat/ck_2022-05973_ihracat_destekleri_hakkinda_karar.htm">2022/5973)</a></span></i><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'><o:p> </o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>Amaç
ve kapsam<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>MADDE
1 - </span></b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>(1) Bu Tebliğin amacı, yurt içinde
düzenlenen uluslararası fuarlara katılan yabancı firmaların fuar eşyasının
ithalatının düzenlenmesidir.<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>Dayanak<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>MADDE
2 -</span></b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'> (1)<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'> </b>Bu Tebliğ, <a
data-tooltip='CK 00001 Cumhurbaşkanlığı Teşkilatı Hakkında Cumhurbaşkanlığı Kararnamesi (Kararname Numarası 1)' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/digerleri/ck_00001_cumhurbaskanligi_teskilati_hakkinda_cumhurbaskanligi_kararnamesi_x1kararname_numarasi_1x2.htm">1
sayılı</a> Cumhurbaşkanlığı Teşkilatı Hakkında Cumhurbaşkanlığı Kararnamesinin
445 inci maddesi ile 31/12/2020 tarihli ve <a
data-tooltip='CK 2020-03350 İthalat Rejimi Kararı' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/ithalat/ck_2020-03350_ithalat_rejimi_karari.htm">3350</a>
sayılı Cumhurbaşkanı Kararıyla yürürlüğe konulan İthalat Rejimi Kararına
dayanılarak hazırlanmıştır.<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>Yurt
içinde düzenlenen </span></b><b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>uluslararası
fuarlar ve sergilere getirilen eşya<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>MADDE
3 - </span></b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>(1) Ülkemizde düzenlenen uluslararası
fuar veya sergilere yabancı ülke veya firmalar sadece teşhir amacıyla
katılabilirler. Perakende satış yapamazlar.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>(2) Fuar bitiminden sonra yabancı ülke veya
firmaların teşhir ettikleri malların gümrük mevzuatı çerçevesinde kesin
ithalatı yapılabilir.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3-normalyaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><b><span
style='font-size:11.0pt'>Yürürlükten kaldırılan tebliğ <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=3-normalyaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><b><span
style='font-size:11.0pt'>MADDE 4</span></b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt'> - </span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt'>(1)<b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'> </b>31/12/2024 tarihli ve 32769 üçüncü
mükerrer sayılı Resmî Gazete'de yayımlanan</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'> Yurt İçinde
Düzenlenen Uluslararası Fuarlara İlişkin Tebliğ (İthalat: <a
data-tooltip='2025-01 Yurt İçinde Düzenlenen Uluslararası Fuarlara İlişkin İthalat Tebliği' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/ticaret_politikalari/ithalat/2025-01_yurt_icinde_duzenlenen_uluslararasi_fuarlara_iliskin_ithalat_tebligi.htm">2025/1)</a></span><span
style='font-size:11.0pt'> yürürlükten kaldırılmıştır.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Atıflar<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>MADDE 5</span></b><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'> - </span></b><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>(1)<b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'> </b>31/12/2024 tarihli ve </span><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>32769 üçüncü
mükerrer </span><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>sayılı
Resmî Gazete'de yayımlanan</span><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'> Yurt İçinde
Düzenlenen Uluslararası Fuarlara İlişkin Tebliğ (İthalat: 2025/1)'e yapılan
atıflar bu Tebliğe yapılmış sayılır.</span><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>
<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>Yürürlük<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>MADDE
6 -</span></b><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'> (1) Bu Tebliğ 1/1/2026 tarihinde
yürürlüğe girer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
line-height:normal'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>Yürütme<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt;
